avy weapons.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/4357dfbeed571470a8f1b6aa050a0020.poster.avif?t=1760364619\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/4357dfbeed571470a8f1b6aa050a0020.webm?t=1760364619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/4357dfbeed571470a8f1b6aa050a0020.mp4?t=1760364619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Dungeon</strong><br>Explore hidden dungeons scattered throughout the world.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/38ef52992038076e4986aa32a98f98c4.poster.avif?t=1760364619\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/38ef52992038076e4986aa32a98f98c4.webm?t=1760364619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/38ef52992038076e4986aa32a98f98c4.mp4?t=1760364619\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Vehicle</strong><br>Get in a vehicle for safety. It will become a moving fortress.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/caeecf112f09449f7a4ff458505e794a.poster.avif?t=1760364619\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/caeecf112f09449f7a4ff458505e794a.webm?t=1760364619\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1377380/extras/caeecf112f09449f